00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:31.760
it's about a good 70 percent that
the people cannot hear.

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:38.720
- Yeah, OK.
- So you hearin’ about 30 percent on
the nightly. A good 70 is

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:42.160
